WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:09.560
To experience living abroad
was always one of my dreams.

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:14.960
Because I was curious to learn about
new cultures, new ways of thinking.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.120
I contacted several EU companies,
I got five replies back.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:24.000
One of them was from
Velux in Denmark.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
I worked there as an intern
assisting the social media department.

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:37.840
After five months,
I got a three-month contract.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.640
After that I was given responsibility
for training the Baltic countries.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.960
My life has changed dramatically
since I moved here.

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:55.240
Ive learnt new things,
the way I work, organise my time.

00:00:55.800 --> 00:01:02.200
I identify a lot with the Nordic lifestyle
I like the tolerance

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:07.760
I like the culture of the people.
I like the order. I like the openness.

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:13.440
Another aspect which motivates me is
knowing that there are the conditions

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:16.560
and opportunities here that will
allow me to develop my career.

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:20.200
And on a personal level
its one of those experiences

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:22.640
in which you integrate
into a new culture.

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:26.600
Learn new languages.
Its not at all easy,

00:01:26.680 --> 00:01:32.520
but its very gratifying and I will certainly
enjoy the benefits in the future.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:41.760
Erasmus+ gives me an opportunity
to use my professional skills.

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:44.680
To grow as a person,
with a global mind set.

00:01:44.760 --> 00:01:46.960
And launch my career.

